{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/mistergatotop.png?t=1742242234\" /><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mister Gato Idle</strong> is an <strong>idle</strong> and <strong>incremental\u00a0</strong>game designed to be a &quot;<strong>2nd</strong> <strong>Monitor</strong>&quot; game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a banjo wielding tuxedo cat named <strong>Mister Gato</strong> on his quest to purrfect <i><strong>The</strong> <strong>Mew</strong> <strong>Sound</strong></i> and become the next <i><strong>Meowsiah</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies, collect currency, pull loot, draw random skills and craft the ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/2ndmonitor2.png?t=1742242234\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is <strong>NOT</strong> a mobile port/game! I often play idle games on mobile and find myself installing android emulators to play them on my PC. Often they are left there idling on the 2nd monitor. Mister Gato Idle's aspect ratio is chosen for this purpose, leave it running whilst you play your main game and come back to it and reap the farm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/FeaturesStea3m.png?t=1742242234\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm currency and conquer waves, how far can you get?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventure across over 20 different biomes each one has a positive and negative effect!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No red dots, no daily login, no P2W, no shop, no ads!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offline loot based on KPM (kills per min) for up to 24 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Cloud save with local (encrypted) option.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter <strong>Super Banjo Mode</strong> for a strategic damage/hp boost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/vlc_MKZ0C2hAlR.gif?t=1742242234\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect <strong>Crystals</strong> and use them to pull <strong>Cards</strong>. There are <strong>6</strong> card rarities with the most rare being <strong>Unique</strong> cards that provide powerful special bonuses. Each card has a chance of rolling 2 or 3x a stat. Equip up to 10 cards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/Unity_EQde5gd8Gh.gif?t=1742242234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm <strong>Crystals</strong> and randomly create <strong>skills</strong>. Equip up to <strong>4</strong> skills of varying rarities.\u00a0 There are no set skills so it's entirely up to you which ones you equip.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/SkillForge2.png?t=1742242234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a DPS meter so you can tell which skills are performing and what your highest source of damage is. These are logged to files so external DPS meters can be created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/Unity_ZAhujMRIPW.gif?t=1742242234\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/TheMewSonnd.png?t=1742242234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your basic skill starts humble but as you collect <strong>Orbs</strong> you can upgrade\u00a0<strong>The Mew Sound </strong>and<strong>\u00a0</strong>become the next <strong>Meowsiah!</strong>\u00a0Apply orbs of differing rarities to upgrade your basic skill. The rarest orbs provide powerful buffs at a trade off. This system can be expanded in the future to apply all sorts of random effects and curve RNG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/MewSound2.png?t=1742242234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The limits of Mister Gato are endless, how far can he really go is up to you!  <strong>join</strong> the <strong>community</strong>, find the meta, give me your feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527030?t=1742242234","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/7d6fe52289af2e92