farm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/FeaturesStea3m.png?t=1742242234\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm currency and conquer waves, how far can you get?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventure across over 20 different biomes each one has a positive and negative effect!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No red dots, no daily login, no P2W, no shop, no ads!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offline loot based on KPM (kills per min) for up to 24 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Cloud save with local (encrypted) option.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter <strong>Super Banjo Mode</strong> for a strategic damage/hp boost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/vlc_MKZ0C2hAlR.gif?t=1742242234\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect <strong>Crystals</strong> and use them to pull <strong>Cards</strong>. There are <strong>6</strong> card rarities with the most rare being <strong>Unique</strong> cards that provide powerful special bonuses. Each card has a chance of rolling 2 or 3x a stat. Equip up to 10 cards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/Unity_EQde5gd8Gh.gif?t=1742242234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm <strong>Crystals</strong> and randomly create <strong>skills</strong>. Equip up to <strong>4</strong> skills of varying rarities.\u00a0 There are no set skills so it's entirely up to you which ones you equip.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/SkillForge2.png?t=1742242234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a DPS meter so you can tell which skills are performing and what your highest source of damage is. These are logged to files so external DPS meters can be created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/Unity_ZAhujMRIPW.gif?t=1742242234\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/TheMewSonnd.png?t=1742242234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your basic skill starts humble but as you collect <strong>Orbs</strong> you can upgrade\u00a0<strong>The Mew Sound </strong>and<strong>\u00a0</strong>become the next <strong>Meowsiah!</strong>\u00a0Apply orbs of differing rarities to upgrade your basic skill. The rarest orbs provide powerful buffs at a trade off. This system can be expanded in the future to apply all sorts of random effects and curve RNG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/MewSound2.png?t=1742242234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The limits of Mister Gato are endless, how far can he really go is up to you!  <strong>join</strong> the <strong>community</strong>, find the meta, give me your feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Mister Gato"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/header.jpg?t=1742242234","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109496,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109496/movie480.mp4?t=1741793539","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109496/movie_max.mp4?t=1741793539"},"name":"Mister Gato Idle - Intro","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257109496/f154bb63c705e3072686320c867163d0f2946c56/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741793539","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109496/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741793539","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109496/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741793539"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257110680,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110680/movie480.mp4?t=1741793536","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110680/movie_max.mp4?t=1741793536"},"name":"Mister Gato Idle - Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257110680/26b15b82c6ede0398734b145c7c97bdc08882230/movie_600x3